# The manifest of those four, and nothing else: every one of its 193 entries is
# under decor/, tiles/ or buildings/. Nothing the game runs reads it — the
# battle map takes a prop's footprint from BattleMapGen's own table, not from
# intrinsic sizes — so it stays ignored even though part of what it describes
# is now versioned. tools/make_art_manifest.py rebuilds it from the disk.
src/assets/images/art.json

# One line read aloud by each of the speech model's non-English voices, for
# deciding by ear whether any of them belong in the cast. Scratch for a human
# judgement, not an asset: no page references them, deploy.sh excludes them,
# and `tools/gen_voiceover.py --sample-accents` makes them again in a minute.
src/assets/audio/vo/_accent_samples/

# The character look library, baked by src/tools/bake_looks.py from a snapshot
# of the Odin creator: 12,892 looks x four pictures, ~0.6 GB in ~51k files.
# It is a build product, reproducible byte-for-byte from the snapshot its
# manifest.json names, and a clone carrying it would be twenty times the size
# of everything else in the repository. src/assets/data/looks_options.json —
# the closed lists the game validates against — IS versioned; the pictures
# are not. Shipped to hermes by its own script, never by deploy.sh (see
# rsync-excludes).
src/assets/looks/
